            "value": "保存会在源文件旁创建仅当前用户可读写、名称唯一的 YAML，不改变原文件。导入不会启动容器；分享新文件前请检查挂载和敏感值。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存會在來源檔案旁建立僅目前使用者可讀寫、名稱唯一的 YAML，不改變原檔。匯入不會啟動容器；分享新檔前請檢查掛載與敏感值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerSaveImport": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save & Import"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存并导入"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存並匯入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerSourceChanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source changed after preview. Choose it again to review the latest version."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览后源文件已改变。请重新选择并检查最新版本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預覽後來源檔案已改變。請重新選擇並檢查最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerSaveFailed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not create a new configuration beside the source. Check folder permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法在源文件旁创建新配置。请检查文件夹权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法在來源檔案旁建立新設定。請檢查資料夾權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerBuildWrapper": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A single app service will build this Dockerfile from its parent folder. Image defaults are retained; EXPOSE does not automatically publish host ports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将创建单个 app 服务，以父文件夹为上下文构建此 Dockerfile。保留镜像默认值；EXPOSE 不会自动发布主机端口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將建立單個 app 服務，以父資料夾為內容建置此 Dockerfile。保留映像檔預設值；EXPOSE 不會自動發佈主機連接埠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerArchitectureBlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This importer targets linux/arm64. Verify image/base-image support and adjust architecture explicitly; x86 or GPU workloads are not converted automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此导入器面向 linux/arm64。请验证镜像／基础镜像支持并明确调整架构；不会自动转换 x86 或 GPU 工作负载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此匯入器適用於 linux/arm64。請驗證映像檔／基底映像檔支援並明確調整架構；不會自動轉換 x86 或 GPU 工作負載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerOverridesBlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An adjacent override file was found. Export a reviewed, merged Compose file first; this converter does not apply multiple files or profiles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现同目录的覆盖文件。请先导出并检查合并后的 Compose 文件；此转换器不处理多文件合并或 profiles。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發現同目錄的覆寫檔案。請先匯出並檢查合併後的 Compose 檔案；此轉換器不處理多檔合併或 profiles。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerVersionRemoved": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removed obsolete Compose version metadata; service settings are preserved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除旧版 Compose 版本元数据，保留服务设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除舊版 Compose 版本中繼資料，保留服務設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerUnsupported": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This property has no supported conversion. Adjust it explicitly; it will not be silently removed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此属性尚无支持的转换方式。请明确调整；不会静默删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此屬性尚無支援的轉換方式。請明確調整；不會靜默刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerNamesChanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fixed container_name is replaced by project-scoped names. Service keys remain; review hard-coded hostnames and scripts that use old container names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定 container_name 将替换为项目专属名称。服务键保持不变；请检查固定主机名及使用旧容器名称的脚本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定 container_name 將替換為專案專屬名稱。服務鍵保持不變；請檢查固定主機名稱及使用舊容器名稱的腳本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerRestartManual": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restart policy becomes \"no\". Containers require manual start/stop; there is no crash recovery or boot-time restart supervisor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重启策略改为“no”。容器需要手动启动／停止；没有崩溃恢复或开机自动重启控制器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重啟原則改為「no」。容器需要手動啟動／停止；沒有當機復原或開機自動重啟控制器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerRestartBlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic restart cannot be preserved. Adjust the source or explicitly allow manual start/stop above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法保留自动重启。请修改源文件，或明确勾选上方的手动启动／停止选项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法保留自動重啟。請修改來源檔案，或明確勾選上方的手動啟動／停止選項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerBuildContext": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added the Compose default build context: the source folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已补上 Compose 默认构建上下文：源文件夹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已補上 Compose 預設建置內容：來源資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerExposeRemoved": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removed expose metadata. It does not publish a host port; same-network connectivity remains governed by the runtime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除 expose 元数据。它不会发布主机端口；同网络连接仍由运行时控制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已移除 expose 中繼資料。它不會發佈主機連接埠；同網路連線仍由執行環境控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerNetworkList": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Converted empty per-network mappings to a network-name list; no aliases were discarded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将空的逐网络映射转换为网络名称列表，没有丢弃别名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已將空的逐網路對應轉換為網路名稱清單，沒有捨棄別名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerEnvFileShort": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Converted a required env_file path to short syntax; file contents stay in the original file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将必需的 env_file 路径转换为短语法；内容保留在原文件中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已將必要的 env_file 路徑轉換為短語法；內容保留在原檔案中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerPortsShort": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Converted an explicit long-form port mapping to short syntax."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将明确的长格式端口映射转换为短语法。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已將明確的長格式連接埠對應轉換為短語法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerLoopback": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Published ports bind to 127.0.0.1. Other computers cannot connect through the Mac's LAN address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发布端口绑定到 127.0.0.1。其他电脑无法通过 Mac 的局域网地址连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發佈連接埠綁定至 127.0.0.1。其他電腦無法透過 Mac 的區域網路位址連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerSocketBlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Docker socket mount requires the Docker API and cannot be migrated automatically to Apple Container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker 套接字挂载依赖 Docker API，无法自动迁移到 Apple Container。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker Socket 掛載依賴 Docker API，無法自動遷移至 Apple Container。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerDefaultDriver": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses an Apple Container-managed resource instead of Docker's default driver. Driver options and custom drivers are not converted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将使用 Apple Container 管理的资源，替代 Docker 默认驱动程序。不转换驱动选项或自定义驱动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將使用 Apple Container 管理的資源，取代 Docker 預設驅動程式。不轉換驅動選項或自訂驅動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerVolumeData": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker volume contents are NOT copied. Managed volumes start separately; migrate and verify application data before switching services. External volumes must already exist in Apple Container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会复制 Docker 卷内容。受管卷单独创建；切换服务前请迁移并验证应用数据。外部卷必须已存在于 Apple Container。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不會複製 Docker 儲存卷內容。受管理儲存卷另外建立；切換服務前請遷移並驗證應用資料。外部儲存卷必須已存在於 Apple Container。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerImageStore": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker's local image store is separate. Publish/import local-only images or supply a build context before starting; image architecture and availability are verified when pulling/building."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker 本地镜像存储是独立的。启动前请发布／导入仅本地存在的镜像，或提供构建上下文；下载／构建时才验证镜像架构和可用性。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker 本機映像檔儲存區是獨立的。啟動前請發佈／匯入僅本機存在的映像檔，或提供建置內容；下載／建置時才驗證映像檔架構與可用性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerRuntimeCheck": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This report validates configuration, not application behavior. Build/pull, credentials, health and data must still be tested. Host environment variables are not inherited; use an adjacent .env file. No Docker daemon or existing container is changed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此报告验证配置，不保证应用行为。仍需测试构建／下载、凭证、健康和数据。不继承主机环境变量；请使用同目录 .env 文件。不会更改 Docker 守护进程或现有容器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此報告驗證設定，不保證應用行為。仍需測試建置／下載、憑證、健康與資料。不繼承主機環境變數；請使用同目錄 .env 檔案。不會更改 Docker Daemon 或現有容器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerUseCompose": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resolve with installed Docker Compose (merges, .env and YAML templates)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用已安装的 Docker Compose 解析（合并、.env 和 YAML 模板）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用已安裝的 Docker Compose 解析（合併、.env 與 YAML 範本）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerAddOverride": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Override File…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加覆盖文件…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入覆寫檔案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerClearOverrides": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Default Override"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认覆盖文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用預設覆寫檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerAmbiguousOverride": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multiple default override files were found. Choose the overrides explicitly in order."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现多个默认覆盖文件。请按顺序明确选择覆盖文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發現多個預設覆寫檔案。請依序明確選擇覆寫檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerComposeMissing": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker Compose CLI was not found. Install it, or turn off official resolution to use the limited standalone parser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 Docker Compose CLI。请安装它，或关闭官方解析以使用功能有限的独立解析器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 Docker Compose CLI。請安裝它，或關閉官方解析以使用功能有限的獨立解析器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerComposeResolveFailed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker Compose could not resolve this project. Check syntax, referenced files and required variables locally; diagnostics are hidden because they may contain secrets."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker Compose 无法解析此项目。请在本地检查语法、引用文件与必需变量；诊断可能包含敏感值，因此不在此显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Docker Compose 無法解析此專案。請在本機檢查語法、引用檔案與必要變數；診斷可能包含敏感值，因此不在此顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerComposeVariableMissing": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compose reported an unset variable. Define it in the project .env and review again; blank substitution is not accepted automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compose 报告变量未设置。请在项目 .env 定义后重新检查；不会自动接受空值替换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compose 回報變數未設定。請在專案 .env 定義後重新檢查；不會自動接受空值替換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerComposeResolved": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Official Compose resolved the selected files in order, including YAML templates, .env and env_file. The generated file contains a fixed snapshot of resolved values; changes in those inputs require reconversion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方 Compose 已依序解析所选文件，包括 YAML 模板、.env 和 env_file。生成文件保存解析后值的固定快照；输入变化后需要重新转换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方 Compose 已依序解析所選檔案，包括 YAML 範本、.env 與 env_file。產生檔案保存解析後值的固定快照；輸入變更後需要重新轉換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerResourceNames": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non-external resources get project-scoped Apple Container names. Existing Docker resources and their data remain separate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非外部资源采用项目专属 Apple Container 名称。现有 Docker 资源与数据保持独立。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非外部資源採用專案專屬 Apple Container 名稱。既有 Docker 資源與資料保持獨立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dockerResolvedRuntimeCheck": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configuration resolution does not certify runtime compatibility or migrate data. Only project env files supply variables; shell values are not inherited. Save rechecks the resolved inputs. No Docker workload is started or stopped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置解析不代表运行时兼容或数据迁移完成。仅使用项目环境文件，不继承 shell 变量。保存前会重新检查解析结果；不会启动或停止 Docker 工作负载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定解析不代表執行環境相容或資料遷移完成。僅使用專案環境檔案，不繼承 shell 變數。儲存前會重新檢查解析結果；不會啟動或停止 Docker 工作負載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
